    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107132" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεναντιόομαι</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπηναντίωμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demetr.Lac.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1012.37
				</span></i>
			:—<i>do what one can to oppose,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῷ νοσήματι μετὰ τοῦ ἰητροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.11
				</span></i>
			; <i>oppose secretly, thwart,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Caes.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be opposed</i> or <i>opposite,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EE</u>
				1240a12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phgn.</u>
				807a26
			</span></i>.</div>
